    "summary": "An oval wooden face mask tapering slightly to the chin; the hair represented by groups of horizontal and vertical grooves and decorated with a band with three knobs (one now missing); forehead, nose and mouth project from the flat facial\nplane which is decorated with rows of painted dots; small ears are placed at eye\nlevel; the back is slightly hollowed and is encircled by small fastening holes closely spaced around the larger area below the hairline; larger and more widely spaced fastening holes around the upper area.",
